{"id":23858423134459,"type":"artist","name":"Split Enz","artist":null,"year":1972,"weight":19,"info":{"tags":["new wave","New Zealand","80s","rock","pop"],"country":"NZ","begin":"1972","end":"1984","kind":"Group","similar":["Tim Finn","Crowded House","Finn Brothers","Neil Finn","Mental As Anything","Icehouse","Mi-Sex","Dave Dobbyn","The Mutton Birds","Flowers"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Split_Enz_%22Time_and_Tide%22_%281982_A%26M_publicity_photo%29.jpg?width=500","bio":"Split Enz nació a mediados de los 70, y pronto se convirtió en el grupo más emblemático de Nueva Zelanda.\n\nSu rock irreverente y de canciones de estilo inclasificable les dio un nombre y un hueco en el panorama internacional. Sacaron un primer single, llamado Split Ends, y más tarde grabaron su primer LP, llamado Mental Notes.\n\nEl disco fue un éxito tremendo, y el grupo se lanzó a promocionarlo por medio mundo. Donde más apoyo encontraron fue en Inglaterra, y donde menos en Estados Unidos."},"works":[{"id":251359207008134,"type":"album","name":"Mental Notes","artist":"Split Enz","year":1975,"weight":11,"yt":"emfK0ovEzjs","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":501,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":272008280010615,"type":"album","name":"Second Thoughts","artist":"Split Enz","year":1976,"weight":3,"yt":"z0Mjxi2X-rw","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":223412012833492,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Zolo","rank":24,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":234126140575920,"type":"song","name":"Bold As Brass","artist":"Split Enz","year":1977,"weight":6,"yt":"gTO8lUYi7lc","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":255622043815820,"type":"song","name":"I See Red","artist":"Sp